*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0036
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-07-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 307
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0036.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> STUDENT INDICATOR Y/N
    05 S-IN               PIC X.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 C-AG-YY            PIC 9(3).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 WS-FWV             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> MONTHLY SERVICE FEE
    05 WS-MFEE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM AGE-FEE-RULES
    DISPLAY "WS-FWV=" WS-FWV
    DISPLAY "WS-MFEE=" WS-MFEE
    STOP RUN.
AGE-FEE-RULES.
    IF S-IN = 'Y' AND C-AG-YY LESS THAN 26
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-FWV
        MOVE 0 TO WS-MFEE
    ELSE
        IF C-AG-YY NOT LESS THAN 65
            MOVE 'Y' TO WS-FWV
            MOVE 0 TO WS-MFEE
        ELSE
            MOVE 9.00 TO WS-MFEE
        END-IF
    END-IF.
